#: a876f1e2e318430c8a5c447b6af0a69d
msgid "The parameters above are recommended for SITL. If you plan on using this on a real copter, it is a good idea to setup a second source of EKF. This way the robot doesn't crash if the external odometry you are providing stops publishing or gets lost."
msgstr ""

